    "answer": {
      "short": "$229$ metres",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}18+27+83+12+89&=(18+12)+(27+83)+89\\\\18+27+83+12+89&=30+110+89\\\\18+27+83+12+89&=229\\end{align*}$$\nThe total length required was $229$ metres.",
